-- Tracking-source description curation (2 August 2026): the seeded
-- descriptions were portal NAMES ('ETA e-invoicing portal') --
-- accurate but unhelpful for deciding what a page actually announces.
-- Rewritten to say what kind of news/updates each source actually
-- carries, which is exactly the metadata the content-monitoring
-- Worker's digest benefits from when deciding how urgent a detected
-- change is likely to be. All 4 languages.

